#: search2:search2_6C1E3712_DB41_4FC0_9741_04C66D419C6C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 140cfe3597223cdb9c7188bdfcad87d09e7e38cd29a442194833133ef1949e84
