msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Anche tu riesci a vedere quest’incubo distorto...?"

#: search2:search2_CFAAF7D4_A140_4C00_8D5E_8940E170B349
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a82bb46509da0d34390f63dc79260e7198af9fa6f13be059d7d01127a23bb39
