msgctxt "search2:search2_CFAAF7D4_A140_4C00_8D5E_8940E170B349"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫An image of her floating alone in a vast sea of blood flashes through my mind. ⟪k:1⟫That "
"vision kicks me into motion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ho in mente l’immagine di lei che galleggia sola in un vasto mare di sangue. ⟪k:1⟫Quella "
"visione mi mette in moto."

#: search2:search2_33374CBE_24F0_4A09_9138_61414EFC8719
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a6ad8fb9787faf39952d1ae15b24f4fde759a7b751311913e021fb4437298ee
#. default-sha256: faa7d791751d9349c0659b8b0e58ac148faca89ca79a4991ad894aefe20468fe
msgctxt "search2:search2_33374CBE_24F0_4A09_9138_61414EFC8719"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I begin walking—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or, more accurately, dragging my heavy feet forward. ⟪k:3⟫The "
"constant splashing of blood against my ankles grates at my already taut nerves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Inizio a camminare—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫o meglio, a trascinare in avanti i miei piedi appesantiti. ⟪k:3⟫"
"I costanti schizzi di sangue contro le mie caviglie⟪k:4⟫irritano i miei nervi già tesi."

#: search2:search2_A08671D4_1A35_4F99_BDAF_68240B8127C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b765c2225e41bc1f910a6bdddda97aca3c92cd64530bcf3cf41f48670bfcc6c7
#. default-sha256: 37b610d2c85f8e94f91a8b339d72f080754936e68340c3d4bb54678cc1057c21
msgctxt "search2:search2_A08671D4_1A35_4F99_BDAF_68240B8127C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Morgana told me to find my way to her, and I can think of only one place she would be."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Morgana mi ha detto di trovare la strada che conduce a lei, e c’è un solo posto dove "
"potrebbe trovarsi."

#: search2:search2_64DDCD57_C4DD_424C_96BE_39A865E23414
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e18f89f56974cb1866b0be459d0e338615e742432f93d094dd161f0d562f1fbc
